{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Unit\u00a0</strong>is a cinematic, single-player third-person tactical shooter that puts you inside high-risk operations across volatile  hotspots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a Special Forces soldier. Every mission is built on precision, pressure, and consequence, leading to the formation of a covert unit unfolding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic Story Campaign.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a narrative-driven campaign with seamless gameplay-to-cinematic transitions, building toward the creation of a covert special forces unit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced Combat Systems</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy recon and strike drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize kamikaze drones for precision attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in armored support and heavy artillery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute air support and carpet bombing.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Next-Gen Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible battlefields. Delivering highly detailed environments and realistic lighting for immersive combat scenarios, Powered by Nanite and Lumen. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875090?t=1774288250","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875090/82d7629b9ef317443a66f1eb261dee1b8da6b7e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774288250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875090/77e2a38dfa94d5fa973cdfe4df1c419ea0f347e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774288250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875090/77e2a38dfa94d5fa973cdfe4df1c419ea0f347e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774288250","categories":[{"description":"Si